{"id":"vod_sn_37771","vodId":"37771","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"B-PROJECT","name_cn":"B-PROJECT","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/15aa09869c36f8a2685796c6d60029d8.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一家名为犍陀罗music的唱片公司中，澄空翼（金元寿子 配音）是刚刚来到公司的经纪人，然而，初来乍到的她立刻就被通知要同时负责三支偶像小组，一上来就要背负如此艰巨的任务，澄空翼简直怀疑自己是不是被骗了。　　向来以王子形象示人，但实际上非常缺乏生活常识的北门伦毗沙（小野大辅 配音）、身材娇小个性腹黑的是国龙持（岸尾大辅 配音）、个性认真严肃甚至有些古板的金城刚士（丰永利行 配音）、天真浪漫非常友好热情的阿修悠太（花江夏树 配音）、常常沉浸在自己的世界中的爱染健十（加藤和树 配音），澄空翼要应付的，是这些帅气但是麻烦的家伙们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q1sFs93wkn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8S3F5Rwvy61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6HD2jHcMf11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fbguRKVsTc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8YVKHadc311/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/W7rVABUyqB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9wjexcqBhY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6DCi922A801/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xGCS9ZLf9R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RUvnQqM05t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/su2bZHwFHe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YVmNfdVRCF1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:06.828Z"}